<p>
We chatted with Pedro about Org Mode, LaTeX exports and font management
including alternatives and things you can and can't do depending
on your choices.
</p>

<p>
Update <span class="timestamp-wrapper"><time class="timestamp" datetime="2026-10-04">[2026-10-04 Sun]</time></span>: Looks like the issue with the hand emoji was
that there's a regression in TeXLive: LaTeX 2024 produces the PDF with
the right fonts and colours, but LaTeX 2026 doesn't.
</p>

