</p><div class="full-transcript"><p></p><div class="transcript-heading"><span class="audio-time" data-start="0.000000">0:00</span> <strong>Opening</strong></div><p></p><span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="0.031000" data-stop="3.528000"><strong class="speaker-name">Sacha:</strong>  But first, I will press the go live</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="3.568000" data-stop="5.738000">button because this time I'm going to remember.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="9.042000" data-stop="13.068000">Okay, now I think we are live.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="13.829000" data-stop="17.014000">Welcome to Emacs Chat 31.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="17.034000" data-stop="20.840000">Today we have Pedro Aranda Gutierrez, who is here</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="20.900000" data-stop="23.212000">to talk about all the cool things</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="23.213000" data-stop="24.706000">with Org LaTeX Export.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="25.527000" data-stop="28.612000">And Prot is here also because he knows a lot more</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="28.652000" data-stop="30.795000">about fonts and writing in multiple languages and</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="30.815000" data-stop="31.356000">all that stuff.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="31.376000" data-stop="33.559000">So I'm counting on Prot to ask questions when my</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Sacha" data-start="33.579000" data-stop="37.345000">mind just goes like, ooh, cool demo.</span> <p></p><span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="37.848000" data-stop="42.934000"><strong class="speaker-name">Pedro:</strong>  Hello, here we are.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="44.256000" data-stop="49.803000">So yes, I wanted to talk about what is news for all.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="50.544000" data-stop="55.269000">At least this part, the integration of the basic</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="55.309000" data-stop="61.937000">font management with lualatex is in main</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="61.938000" data-stop="63.079000">right now in Org Mode.</span> <p></p><span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Prot" data-start="64.358000" data-stop="65.239000"><strong class="speaker-name">Prot:</strong>  Very well, very well.</span> <p></p><span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="65.259000" data-stop="70.968000"><strong class="speaker-name">Pedro:</strong>  I was not expecting that to happen,</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="70.969000" data-stop="73.072000">but it happened.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="73.092000" data-stop="74.194000">So that's the situation.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="74.755000" data-stop="80.004000">And I would just like to go stepwise on what you</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="80.044000" data-stop="82.468000">have to do, what you can do, what you can't do</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="83.289000" data-stop="84.932000">with these things.</span> <p></p><div class="transcript-heading"><span class="audio-time" data-start="84.000000">1:24</span> <strong>Setting things up</strong></div><p></p><span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="84.912000" data-stop="90.099000"><strong class="speaker-name">Pedro:</strong> This is my Emacs 31 compiled a couple of days</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="90.139000" data-stop="91.821000">ago and I'm on devel.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="92.081000" data-stop="97.167000">I'm on main here, on main for Org mode.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="98.549000" data-stop="102.054000">I have a small Org file here which initially</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="102.154000" data-stop="104.777000">I'm going to be using pdflatex to compile,</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="106.073000" data-stop="109.218000">with a trick: I'm not compiling in the background,</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="109.279000" data-stop="113.165000">but I have a script here in the terminal to have</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="113.205000" data-stop="117.413000">a bit more of feedback or direct feedback of what</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="117.493000" data-stop="118.054000">is happening.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="119.296000" data-stop="122.901000">If we go through this...</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="122.902000" data-stop="127.550000">I mean this is basically my template</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="127.830000" data-stop="129.854000">to start any article. It's going to be an</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="129.954000" data-stop="130.495000">article.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="132.533000" data-stop="134.296000">we are going to use pdflatex.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="135.358000" data-stop="141.770000">And the other thing is I have a very small thing</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="141.891000" data-stop="144.596000">with the default font.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="144.676000" data-stop="147.100000">Then I have also the Sans Serif font.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="147.701000" data-stop="152.871000">I also have some monospaced fonts with it.</span> <p></p><div class="transcript-heading"><span class="audio-time" data-start="153.000000">2:33</span> <strong>Local variables
