2.844000">Everything is plain.</span> <span class="audio-time caption" data-speaker="Pedro" data-start="233.726000" data-stop="236.830000">If I go and just go and export...</span> <p></p><div class="transcript-heading"><span class="audio-time" data-start="236.000000">3:56</span> <strong>Mini export menu
